 4. 📸 Pic du jour 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: @MargoMartin47 via X President Trump and New York Mayor Zohran Mamdani — facing the East River — take questions from reporters after a friendly meeting in Gracie Mansion on the Upper East Side yesterday.

 Trump said he wants Mamdani "to be a great mayor" and that he has "great potential." More from the meeting . Image: TRUMP TV/YouTube This "Simpsons" frame is from a montage that kicked off the White House's TRUMP TV YouTube channel , which was months in the making but was rushed to air last night amid the press-access fight.

 The channel, which'll have some theme days, promises : "All the top hits, wins, + more. Streaming 24/7 on your phone or tv." 
 
